{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261018/photo/bkn-20261018130344277-1018_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261018141615\"/><p>涉事巴士上層車頭擋風玻璃出現裂痕。</p><p>新皇崗口岸發生交通意外。今晨(18日)11時36分，一輛路線B10，由葵芳開往新皇崗口岸的九巴雙層巴士，疑意外駛入惇裕路聯檢大樓底層的跨境巴士候車區，撞到懸掛於天花頂部的交通指示牌，導致上層車頭擋風玻璃出現裂痕，幸事件中無人受傷，意外原因待查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T06:18:47.493445+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T05:03:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T06:37:39.171172+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T06:17:37.565575+00:00","content_hash":"93dbd0a92ae46708fa5bf9ff41427bb1f0b33d7176609ca11a603533c2cb5b5d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}